{{!-- Tauri's own template with one line changed: the `%F` on `Exec`, without
which the spec says a launcher passes no file name — TFolio would be in the file
manager's "open with" and would still start empty. `deb` and `rpm` both point
here, and the AppImage takes the entry the deb built.

A Handlebars comment rather than the entry format's own `#`, which would ship
this note to every reader's /usr/share/applications. --}}
[Desktop Entry]
Categories={{categories}}
{{#if comment}}
Comment={{comment}}
{{/if}}
Exec={{exec}} %F
StartupWMClass={{exec}}
Icon={{icon}}
Name={{name}}
Terminal=false
Type=Application
{{#if mime_type}}
MimeType={{mime_type}}
{{/if}}
